# Internal: the planning, specification and research layer is maintained outside this
# repository and must never be published.
# Anchored with a leading slash: a bare `CLAUDE.md` would also exclude the templates
# the plugin writes and the example projects, and on a case-insensitive filesystem a
# bare `PLAN.md` would also exclude `plugin/templates/dev/*/plan.md`.
/PLAN.md
/CLAUDE.md
/docs/integration.md
/docs/research/
/docs/decisions/
/docs/testing/
